I look around the room.
This is my new room.
It is quiet here.
There is a switch on the wall.
I press the switch.
The ceiling fan starts running.
There is a bed here.
There is also a sturdy table.
There is a window over there.
I look outside from the window.
It is night right now.
Outside is the city of Mumbai.
The city is enormous.
There are lights everywhere.
This city is unfamiliar to me.
I feel a little lonely.
Mexico is very far away.
I feel a sharp pang for Mexico.
